<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκολλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glued together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			:—mostly in Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκόλλως</span>, <i>in accordance
			with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					310
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἔχειν</span> to agree, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				542
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κολλᾶν τι ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					7.6
				</span></i>
			: also neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος σύγκολλα . . τεκταίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					867
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
